"Stock materials for tools/cad recipes (LLF-69). parts[].material names a key here. densityKgM3 drives manifest massKg/inertia; pbr is passed to cad_export_body.materialsOverride as {name, pbrMetallicRoughness:pbr}. Add a stock here (with a source) before using it in a recipe. 'effective-*' stocks are for parts modelled solid that are really hollow assemblies: their density is the spec-sheet weight divided by the modelled volume."
